.subckt DUT VIN VOUT VSS VREF
* Short-channel PMOS pass bank
XMPASS VOUT gate VIN VIN sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=100 l=0.15 m=5

* Resistor-set PMOS bias and 10:1 tail current mirror
XMPBIAS pbias pbias VIN VIN sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=10 l=2
RBIAS pbias VSS 400k
XMPTAIL ptail pbias VIN VIN sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=100 l=2

* PMOS differential feedback pair with NMOS mirror load
XMPREF ndref VREF ptail VIN sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=45 l=0.5
XMPFB a vfb ptail VIN sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=45 l=0.5
XNREF ndref ndref VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=9 l=1
XNOUT a ndref VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=9 l=1

* Class-A pass-gate driver: bias-mirrored PMOS source and error-controlled NMOS sink
XMPUP gate pbias VIN VIN sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=100 l=1.7
XNDRIVE gate a VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=50 l=1


* Output feedback divider and Miller compensation with a series zero
RTOP VOUT vfb 100k
RBOT vfb VSS 100k
RZ a cnode 36k
CCOMP cnode gate 0.65p
.ends DUT
